 "remarks": "Set in Stamford's Mid-Ridges neighborhood, this fully renovated and updated home features hardwood floors throughout and an inviting layout designed for comfortable living and entertaining. The main level welcomes you with a grand foyer that opens to an open-concept living and dining room flowing into the eat-in kitchen, complete with an island, stainless steel appliances, quartz countertops and custom cabinetry. Just off the kitchen, the family room features a wood-burning fireplace, built-in speakers and a wet bar, providing a warm and inviting space for relaxing or entertaining. A powder room and mudroom with convenient access to the attached garage complete the main level. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite features dual walk-in closets and a private bathroom with a double vanity and oversized shower. Three additional bedrooms, a full bathroom and a conveniently located laundry room complete the upper level. The lower level offers a large rec room, cedar closet and flexible rooms ideal for a home gym, office or additional storage. Conveniently located near parks, shopping, local restaurants and Stamford's many amenities.",
